Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.76,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,We're finally doing real match prep,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:14.54,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,so why's the squad team\N full of first-years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.02,0:00:17.73,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,I heard they've been doing \Nspecial nightly training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.73,0:00:18.74,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:36.30,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Yo. You guys look fatigued as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.30,0:00:39.32,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,You really think you can \Ngive us a game in that state?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:40.85,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Fatigued?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:43.38,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,No time for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:48.77,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Cut the crap. You look \Nthe most tired out of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.53,0:00:56.71,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I'll crush you, you little shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:00.03,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.39,0:01:03.85,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Like Ashito said, \Nwe ain't got time to say we're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:07.87,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,"If the squad players are weak, \Nthe starters will eventually grow weak."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:09.98,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,Right. We heard that from Kuroda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:15.49,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Those words from Manager Fukuda \Nmotivated us to get to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.46,0:01:18.49,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,We can't let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.65,0:01:24.39,Flashback,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,At this moment in time, \Nwho is the best player in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:26.18,Flashback,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I want that player to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.59,0:01:28.47,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:32.27,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:09.47,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,525)\fnArial\shad0.7\fs22\fscx90\b1\bord1.6\fsp0.5\blur0.2\3c&H9E4D24&\4c&H744B35&\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(151,316)}Aim Higher
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:10.03,Top,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,There's an open space!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.21,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.21,0:03:12.66,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.66,0:03:14.71,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Don't leave it open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.93,0:03:16.09,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Togashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:23.22,Italics,TOGASHI/I,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:24.26,Default,YOSHITSUNE,0,0,0,,Yoiks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:27.62,Default,YOSHITSUNE,0,0,0,,Don't get distracted \Nat the critical moment, my G.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.73,0:03:35.62,Italics,YOSHITSUNE/I,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:38.99,Italics,YOSHITSUNE/I,0,0,0,,Hey, he's pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.37,Italics,YOSHITSUNE/I,0,0,0,,Don't force it. Play it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.37,0:03:40.90,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:48.08,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,It's not just with soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.75,0:03:53.12,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,If you want to widen your field of vision,\N you must train your eyes on a daily basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.12,0:03:56.01,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,You can even train them \Nwhen walking around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.68,0:04:00.97,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,The important thing is to accurately \Nmemorize and assess what you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.83,0:04:04.53,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Stuff like you assuming \Nthe pharmacy sign was red...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:09.26,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,That would've been convenient\N for you, Togashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.74,0:04:12.94,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,"He probably won't hit \Na long pass over here."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.38,0:04:15.64,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,"My team will probably wait for me here."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.29,0:04:20.20,Flashback,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Those kinds of assumptions \Nlead to missed chances to win the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:23.28,Italics,TOGASHI/I,0,0,0,,I need to note everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:28.37,Italics,TOGASHI/I,0,0,0,,A player's line of sight. How his body's turned.\N Where his dominant foot is pointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:29.89,Italics,TOGASHI/I,0,0,0,,And do it accurately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:35.12,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Good eye, Togashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:37.13,Default,KOBAYAKAWA,0,0,0,,Akutsu, stay there. I'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:40.04,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Osie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.49,0:04:41.30,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Koba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:45.68,Default,OSIECK,0,0,0,,Ohtomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:50.22,Default,ANRI,0,0,0,,Offside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:55.05,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,It didn't work out, but Kuroda \Nand Ohtomo are really active today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.73,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:58.92,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.94,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,No frustrated looks. \NJust right back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:07.32,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Good job switching gears, \NOhtomo and Kuroda.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:22.84,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:26.46,Italics,KIRIKI/I,0,0,0,,Nice movement, first-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:28.96,Italics,KIRIKI/I,0,0,0,,It's about concentration\Nrather than skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:31.35,Italics,KIRIKI/I,0,0,0,,They have a shared mental image\N of high-level play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:36.10,Italics,YOSHITSUNE/I,0,0,0,,Fukuda-san's words really sank in, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:46.90,Default,NAGANO,0,0,0,,Nice clearance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:51.66,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Guys. I'm sorry, \Nbut can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.71,0:05:56.50,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\t(30,800,\c&HE1E1E4&\3c&H450504&\4c&H100201&)}The factor that makes the team strong \Nis for us as the squad team to also be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:06:00.11,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,But are we happy with \Njust being the squad team?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.21,0:06:04.44,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Those were inspiring words \Nfrom old man Fukuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:10.51,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,But if that's enough to stir us,\N we'll never be good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.16,0:06:13.65,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,He only sees us as the squad team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:15.37,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,We {\i1}should{\i0} be frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:17.27,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,We can't just settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.96,0:06:20.81,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Let's set our goals higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:25.29,Flashback,ASHITO,0,0,0,,This might only be an intrasquad game,\N but let's crush the A team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:29.99,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I've got to look higher. Look higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:33.31,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Look higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.57,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,The first-years on the squad team\N are super focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.08,0:06:41.92,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,We should guard against counters by—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.92,0:06:46.09,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Their concentration can easily be \Nbroken by getting a goal past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.84,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:58.85,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,My biggest takeaway from the rope drill\N was to do things without being told.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:02.98,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Whenever I took up the wrong position, \NI'd get yanked along and fall over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.98,0:07:04.99,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,After repeating that over and over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.31,0:07:10.36,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,the basics of defending, and Togashi's,\N Takeshima's, and Asari's habits,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.61,0:07:12.74,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,were hammered into me,\N like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:19.01,Italics,YOSHITSUNE/I,0,0,0,,The first-years have a different look\N in their eyes today, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.60,0:07:24.84,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I have no time to open my mouth\N to bark instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:33.64,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Even so, I can tell\Nwhere they want me to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.23,0:07:37.47,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,What connected the four of us\N was just a rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:41.30,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,But I learned something \Nby using it as a visual aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:45.36,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Our bond means we cover for each other\N without the need for words.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:48.41,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,It's an invisible rope,\Nconnecting our fates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:51.45,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.25,0:07:55.35,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,A defensive line is about trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.18,0:08:03.43,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Too bad. A guy like you won't—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.39,0:08:07.92,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Release the ball, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.08,0:08:14.51,Flashback,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,You play soccer to get to the pro level?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:15.84,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:18.85,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,That's been my focus up to this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:23.56,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,If I get signed, I can send money\N to my mom right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:27.52,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,But is that really my goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:30.67,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I said release the {\i1}ball!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.06,0:08:33.53,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:34.29,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,Akutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.29,Default,KURODA,0,0,0,,Nice clear—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.66,0:08:45.04,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,'Kay. Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:49.88,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.33,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Next time. Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.33,0:08:55.76,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,We'll stop 'em next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:56.97,Default,KURODA/OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.36,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:08:59.14,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,Count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.06,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,We'll claw it back, damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:03.06,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,We're not conceding again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:05.06,Default,TOGASHI,0,0,0,,Just you watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:07.27,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,"I want to go pro."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:11.57,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,If that's as far as my dream goes,\NI'll never get to go pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.35,0:09:14.65,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,My commitment isn't strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.32,0:09:19.16,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,The biggest proof of that \Nis how I get distracted by trivial stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:21.67,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,I need to set my sights higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:23.64,Italics,ASHITO/I,0,0,0,,Even higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.92,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Good. This is where it starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.64,0:09:34.27,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Now it's all about practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:38.16,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I hope you boys can keep up.
