Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.49,0:09:58.17,Default,TV HOST,0,0,0,,That concludes the international\N and J.League results.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:01.73,Default,TV HOST,0,0,0,,Boy, it's all heating up, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.73,0:10:03.45,Default,COMMENTATOR,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:05.62,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,Speaking of things heating up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:10.25,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,Now on to the U-18 Prince Takamado\N Trophy Premier League.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.69,0:10:13.24,Default,TV HOST,0,0,0,,Oh, the youth league?
