Dialogue: 1,0:10:16.50,0:10:22.26,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,The title race in Japan's East League\N has come down to three teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:27.39,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,The current leaders, Aomori Seiran, \Nwon the Inter-High last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:31.45,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,With the high school championship and \Nthe U-18 Premier League up for grabs,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.45,0:10:34.52,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,they're aiming to do the treble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:38.21,Default,TV HOST,0,0,0,,Winning a treble is the ultimate goal\N in high school soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.21,0:10:41.07,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,And the challengers aiming to stop them
