Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:47.23,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,are two-time U-18 Premier League \NEast champs, Tokyo City Esperion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:49.79,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,They won the Club Youth Championship\N in the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.79,0:10:52.84,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,Kuribayashi was awarded\Nplayer of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:55.96,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,The strongest youth player\N around is in top form.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.33,0:10:59.40,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,And Funabashi Academy High is in third.
