Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.46,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,It's a three-way race.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.46,0:11:25.96,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,You can't take your eyes off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:30.69,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,But the truth is, these three teams \Nare all about to face the same problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.69,0:11:32.25,Default,HOST,0,0,0,,And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.21,Default,NAE,0,0,0,,The national team tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:39.53,Italics,TV HOST/I,0,0,0,,Oh, right, yeah. \NThe U-18s national team games.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:46.97,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs16\b1\fnGeorgia\fscx90\c&H404544&\fax0.2\move(92,82,92,103)\frz8.3}September Japan U-18s\NCzech Tour Squad
