Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:46.97,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fs14\b1\fnArial\fscx90\c&H404544&\fay-0.018\fax0.26\frz8.6\move(403.5,151.5,403.5,172.5)}FW Yoshitsune Kenta (18)\N\hDF Yamada Yutaka (18)
