Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.53,0:11:43.32,Italics,NAE/I,0,0,0,,Yes. It's a roughly two-week\N training camp in Czechia.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:43.32,0:11:46.97,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,These U-18s away games in Czechia\N couldn't be at a worse time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:49.25,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,It's an honor to be chosen,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:53.15,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,but unlike high school teams, \Nclub youth teams have fewer players.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.98,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,It's not easy to fill the gaps.
