Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.52,0:12:01.42,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,For the next match against Tokyo VANS\Nand the one after against Omiya,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.42,0:12:03.84,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,we're definitely going \Nto be without that quartet.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.84,0:12:07.99,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,We're the most disadvantaged\N by this situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:13.25,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.2\fsp6\fs18\b1\an8\c&H7A7F70&\move(515,175,545,175)}Training Room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:17.29,Default,NAGANO,0,0,0,,I heard raised voices \Nin the manager's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.29,0:12:18.91,Default,OSIECK,0,0,0,,What do you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.91,0:12:20.96,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,We're losing four to the Czechia tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:24.08,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,It's good we won the \NClub Youth Championship,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:28.22,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,but there was no rotation all tournament,\N so the starters are pretty fatigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.77,Default,AKIYAMA,0,0,0,,By "four," you mean \NYoshitsune-san, Yamada-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.77,0:12:34.81,Default,AKIYAMA,0,0,0,,Takasugi, and Kiriki, yeah?\N The usual suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.23,0:12:36.48,Default,SHIMIZU,0,0,0,,Must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:40.23,Default,NAGANO,0,0,0,,Shimura-san's legs are in rough shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:42.17,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,And Taira's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:44.38,Default,OSIECK,0,0,0,,What about Kuribayashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:47.45,Default,OSIECK,0,0,0,,He's in the U-20s, \Nso he's not going to Czechia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:48.99,Default,OSIECK,0,0,0,,Can he play the next three?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:50.55,Default,AKIYAMA,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:54.50,Default,AKIYAMA,0,0,0,,But timing-wise, the first team \Ncould call him back at any point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.50,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,The gulf between the starters \Nand the squad players, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:02.01,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,Who knew it'd come back to bite us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:11.01,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Akutsu. Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:13.77,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Why are you two so indifferent?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:19.45,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,The failure to raise the bar and improve\Nthe younger players falls on our heads, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.21,0:13:22.01,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,So what's with that attitude?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:29.00,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,I wouldn't say I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:32.04,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,But I don't see why \Nit's our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.30,0:13:35.79,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,If they don't improve, \Nthat's their fault, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.78,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I'm interested, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:43.71,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Esperion should be the strongest of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.71,0:13:46.07,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,The whole team needs to be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.07,0:13:46.55,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.48,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I admit, I'd zoned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:52.06,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I was thinking about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:53.81,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:57.56,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Akutsu, we're counting on you \Nwhile we're away in Czechia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:01.31,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Even more so if Kuribayashi\N ends up leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.81,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,First of all, you're too harsh \Non the younger players.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:09.76,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,You, too, Kiriki. Before you leave \Nfor Czechia, give them some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.68,0:14:12.52,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,That's a waste of time, Takasugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:17.96,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,I'm sure Kiriki's mind is already \Npreoccupied with the Czechia tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:22.12,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,When Kuribayashi's not around,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.12,0:14:28.66,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,you lead the national team and Esperion\Nas the playmaker and deep-lying midfielder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:31.97,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,As long as Kuribayashi's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.01,0:14:38.69,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,So you can't stop thinking \Nabout the tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.95,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,Ain't that right, Kiriki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:42.48,Default,KIRIKI,0,0,0,,This is dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:48.62,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,Manager Fukuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:52.48,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Sorry for the delay, but the squad \Nfor the Czechia tour has been announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.97,0:14:54.23,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I'll tell you who's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:56.49,Default,AKIYAMA,0,0,0,,You're telling us personally?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:14:59.03,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,We've had four called up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.37,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Yoshitsune. Yamada.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:02.88,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Takasugi. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:05.13,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Akutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:08.88,Italics,TAKASUGI/I,0,0,0,,What about Kiriki?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.62,0:15:15.16,Italics,AKIYAMA/I,0,0,0,,He's been in every squad since junior youth,\N but now he's been dropped?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:19.37,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Akutsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:22.27,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.82,Default,YOSHITSUNE,0,0,0,,Akkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:28.20,Default,YOSHITSUNE,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:34.38,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:39.04,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,The U-18s manager, Ichimura, \Ntold us his reasoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.64,0:15:43.92,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,He watched every game of the \NClub Youth Championship on video.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:46.17,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,Perhaps it was because \Nyou played every minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.17,0:15:49.05,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,but there were moments \Nwhen you lost concentration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.27,0:15:51.83,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,I'm betting he took fatigue \Ninto consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:54.05,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,For now, you should focus on the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:16:01.49,Italics,MATSUNAGA/I,0,0,0,,Come on, Benzen-san. Akutsu also played \Nevery minute and got chosen instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:03.35,Italics,MATSUNAGA/I,0,0,0,,That reasoning won't persuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:06.06,Default,OSIECK,0,0,0,,U-Um, what about Kuribayashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.40,0:16:09.63,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,The deal with Garulla was for two months,\N so he'll be returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.63,0:16:14.17,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,But the game with Funabashi is a postponement,\N so he can play in that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.02,0:16:17.99,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,After the Funabashi game, \NKuribayashi returns to the first team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.94,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,The four called-up players will play, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:24.65,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,It'll be rough on them, \Nbut we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.65,0:16:25.83,Default,TAKASUGI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.10,0:16:29.53,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Still, those four won't play in the \NTokyo VANS and Omiya games.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:32.34,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,We need to hold out in those two matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.45,0:16:35.09,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,I've done the team sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.72,Default,MATSUNAGA,0,0,0,,Th-That defensive line...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:40.34,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,I understand your concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:43.44,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,The more experienced Kiriki \Nand Kobayakawa will be key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.28,0:16:45.23,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.73,0:16:48.71,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,As our playmaker, \Nyou'll direct the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.10,0:16:52.99,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Kiriki, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:56.60,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,That's the last thing on \Nyour mind right now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:01.37,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,This is what I was talking about, Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.94,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,You, too, Takasugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:11.03,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,You both simply assumed the national team\N call-up was in the bag, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.03,0:17:14.63,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,"We're counting on you while we're away"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:19.39,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:26.67,Default,AKUTSU,0,0,0,,That's why you got overtaken by someone\N you thought was below you, Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:31.48,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:34.53,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,No one's better simply because\N they got a call-up or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:40.38,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,Anyway, the VANS match is coming up, \Nso we're counting on you, Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:42.67,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,Winning by one goal \Nwill be good enough, so—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.67,0:17:44.42,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Win by three goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.43,0:17:50.20,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Kiriki, that's an order from me\N as your manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:54.26,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,As the playmaker, pull this immature team\N together and win at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.12,0:17:59.22,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,If you don't win, \NI'll stop playing you for a while, too.
