Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.98,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\blur0.2\bord0\c&H49494A&\fs13\t(\fs12)\move(309,253,311,247.5)}Tachibana
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.48,0:18:08.98,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\b1\shad0\blur0.2\bord0\c&H49494A&\fs13\t(\fs12)\move(371,253,366,247)}Asari
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.37,0:18:10.90,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:11.74,Top,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,Yes! Score!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.77,0:18:16.99,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Sweet. Now Tachibana, Asari, \Nand Takeshima are on the A team, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:20.05,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,I've been on edge about \Nbeing sent back to the B team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.05,0:18:22.62,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Who knew more first-years\Nwould get promoted?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.00,Default,ROAN,0,0,0,,Tachibana.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:28.20,Default,ROAN,0,0,0,,You'd almost replaced Musashino's Kaneda\N as the Metropolitan League's top scorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:31.63,Default,KAMEYAMA,0,0,0,,Yup. Maybe you should \Nturn down the promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:33.16,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:34.66,Default,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Good luck, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.66,0:18:38.92,Default,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Show Manager Fukuda that \Nthe first-years are capable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:40.76,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:48.24,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,Hey. I'm gonna take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.24,0:18:49.39,Default,ROAN,0,0,0,,Masuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:53.72,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,The tryout players and scouted players\N are all now in the A team.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:56.41,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,It just shows how inadequate \Nthe academy graduates are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.95,0:18:58.53,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,This is no time for us to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.53,0:19:00.78,Default,ROAN,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:05.05,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,I've been invited to these nightly\N training sessions a couple of times,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.05,0:19:06.29,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,but what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:12.00,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,We're exhausted from summer training,\Nand now we're training on dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:14.83,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,We're doing this at night, \Nand honestly, it's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:17.17,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,I just feel my fatigue accumulating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.17,0:19:19.30,Default,ASARI,0,0,0,,I agree with everything you've said.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.30,0:19:20.05,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:24.83,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,But on Thursdays, \NManager Fukuda joins in and coaches us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:27.31,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,Oh, then I'll only come on Thursdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.19,0:19:31.78,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,I'm finally getting game time\N on the B team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.36,Default,MASUKO,0,0,0,,I can't get injured now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.05,0:19:40.32,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own method.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.63,0:19:42.81,Default,OHTOMO,0,0,0,,He's not a bad guy, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.77,0:19:47.08,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,Yeah, there are bound to be \Ndifferent responses to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:49.14,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,We're at the climax of the season,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:51.96,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,and our positions and roles\N are clearly different.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.92,Default,KANEKO,0,0,0,,I've enjoyed watching\N this unique self-training
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.60,Default,KANEKO,0,0,0,,by Aoi-kun's group\Nin the last few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:59.26,Default,KANEKO,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:00.56,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:03.09,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,But I switched with Roan and those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:06.34,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,I got to enjoy snippets \Nof the prime of youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.34,0:20:07.85,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,That's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:13.86,Italics,KANEKO/I,0,0,0,,Out of all the first-years, \Nhis mental bandwidth is something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.86,0:20:15.82,Italics,KANEKO/I,0,0,0,,It's always felt so out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.82,0:20:20.17,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,But he can be so extreme, that Ashito.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:24.13,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,In the last two months, \Nhe's definitely worked the hardest,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:26.37,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,so he's undoubtedly the most tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.15,0:20:31.66,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,And he's undoubtedly the one who's made\Nthe skills his own in this nightly training.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.41,0:20:39.02,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,When met with a wall, \Nhe runs at it with foolish earnestness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:43.38,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,He'd benefit from a more \Nrelaxed approach, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:50.14,Default,YUMA,0,0,0,,But I can't wait to see his special training\N bear fruit in the U-18 Premier League.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:54.39,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,All right. I'm so ready \Nto play in the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.14,0:20:57.88,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.69,0:21:10.51,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,Kiriki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.39,0:21:20.02,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,I didn't know you could \Nmake a face like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.64,0:21:47.70,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,This is the lineup for the \NTokyo VANS match this weekend.
