Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:58.46,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Don't think of it as a game we have \Nto get through without key players.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.15,0:22:00.91,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,There's no need to play for a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:04.96,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Go get the three points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:10.97,Default,CREDITS,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\an7\fnArial\b1\fs16\4a&H00&\shad1.5\bord1.2\3c&H2D1718&\4c&H2D1718&\c&HC5969E&\pos(365,20)}Translation: Tomoko Takedani Sater\NTiming: Andy Ellis\NEditing: SMR\NQuality Control: William Haggard\NTranslation Check: David Saylor
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.25,0:23:37.97,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,Kiriki will act as captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.21,0:23:43.05,Default,FUKUDA,0,0,0,,After the warm-up, we'll play an intrasquad game,\N starters versus squad players.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.34,0:23:48.90,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.78,0:24:03.38,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,You're a starter, \Nso you don't need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.78,0:24:04.42,Default,TACHIBANA,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.92,0:24:10.17,Default,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnArial\b1\fs100\fscx85\an8\blur0.2\c&H022C1C&\pos(323,248)}Aoi
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.31,0:24:16.97,Default,ASHITO,0,0,0,,We'll stop Tokyo VANS from scoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.97,0:24:18.63,Default,TAKESHIMA,0,0,0,,You're too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.98,0:24:19.33,Top,ASARI,0,0,0,,I'll show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:19.90,Default,KURIBAYASHI,0,0,0,,He's so crafty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.90,0:24:21.52,Default,KANEKO,0,0,0,,He's like a wild child.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:23.69,Default,BENZEN,0,0,0,,Do all you can to learn \Nfrom a stronger team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.69,0:24:24.61,Default,NORIKO,0,0,0,,Do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.41,0:24:27.98,Top,ASHITO,0,0,0,,We'll win. We'll win. We'll win!
